The OpenBMB Apache-2.0 license is retained as LICENSE. Original file
headers, source attributions and borrowed-code comments are preserved.
Adaptations for Transformers 5 and GPT-QModel are documented in README.md.
Source hashes and independently read checkpoint-header hashes are recorded
in source_manifest.json. No trained tensor payload is included.

Inherited ChatTTS boundary:
  https://github.com/2noise/ChatTTS
  The OpenBMB 2.6 source explicitly attributes GFSQ, DVAEDecoder, DVAE,
  repetition-penalty processing, audio-code generation and mel decoding to
  ChatTTS/model/dvae.py, ChatTTS/model/processors.py,
  ChatTTS/model/gpt.py and ChatTTS/core.py.
  The 4.5 repetition processor is also AST-identical to ChatTTS's historical
  processor; gen_logits is substantially identical. These functions remain
  inherited code, not independently implemented replacements.

  The source comments name unversioned main URLs. The exact borrowing
  revision and any separate OpenBMB grant have not been established.
  Historical matching implementations exist at:
    cff3b4e5c345f66b75e01fd4b5f36e6839f6192b (2024-10-18, AGPL-3.0)
    e69ffacf83c1ce1df03402f6c72c8199d11bbc91 (2024-07-19, AGPL-3.0)
    52d75d54c1ce58e4ea352358a0ed7c6fa0875308 (2024-06-27, CC-BY-NC-4.0)
  The exact historical license texts are retained as
  LICENSE.ChatTTS-AGPL-3.0 and LICENSE.ChatTTS-CC-BY-NC-4.0.
  The initial 2024-05-28 license was CC-BY-NC-ND-4.0; the 2024-06-01
  revision changed it to CC-BY-NC-4.0, and the 2024-07-15 revision changed
  it to AGPL-3.0. No permissive historical root grant was found.
  See third_party_provenance.json for exact commits, hashes and boundaries.

